# Keyboard: German layout profile name (dead key, Z/Y swap), Command and
# Option keys (Option+D: Alt+D, WM_SYSKEYDOWN; '@' is Option+L there, typed
# like AltGr on Windows: WM_KEYDOWN and WM_CHAR), then Options > Controls > Keyboard: rebind with Escape
# cancelling a capture, and the new keys in a Quick Race.  The bindings are
# saved as DirectInput user maps (DIMap.* in the registry file); run
# kb_rebind_load.seq next on the same HOME and save folder.
# Run with NFSU2_KEYLAYOUT=com.apple.keylayout.German NFSU2_KEY_LOG=1 DIMAP=1.
